Replaces the crammed crimson 'Start here' hero + four equal cards with a calm
command center: compact header (freshness + Sync school moved here), a single
Next-action panel with one primary CTA, a chronological Today timeline with an
8AM–10PM runway bar + live now-line and a Flexible section, and an aside merging
overdue/due-soon/inbox into ONE ranked 'Needs attention' list (overdue first) with
'Since yesterday' (trusted-first) and School connections below. Crimson only for
urgency + the primary action. All handlers/stores/routes preserved; typecheck clean.
